      "value": "When you play a Character — If it's in a terrain where its base statistic is 0, I gain 1 Trial counter.  When I gain my third Trial counter — Sacrifice me. If you do, create a [Dragon Shade 5\/5\/5] Illusion token in target Expedition, then return a card from your Reserve to your hand.",
